  "details": "It's really easy to \"collect avatars\", even ones that you create and upload just for yourself -- different outfits just to keep the performance level sane.  It'd be nice to have sub-folders in favorites, for additional sorting (because a list of 99 gets long to sort through).\n\nAnd please, bump up the favorite capacity (maybe instead of increasing the list size > 99 which would get tedious, maybe nested subdirectories could allow for \"infinite favorite capacity\".\n\nCome on, it's not like a few integers and pointers are going to break your database bank.",
